 ## Invariants
+
+- `openSession(id, { navigation: 'side' })` uses the native context-panel chat tab for that session. The `sessions` grant still gates it. Each session gets its own dedupe key, and repeated opens focus its existing tab. The frame's project owns the panel and the session's directory owns its chat. An unregistered destination answers `NO_DIRECTORY` before opening an empty pinned view. Default navigation keeps the existing main-chat behavior. Web and Electron advertise `features.sideChat`. VS Code and mobile reject side navigation with `UNSUPPORTED`. The SDK refuses side navigation before posting when the host does not advertise it.
 
