+## BTW selection
+
+New BTW selections inherit the source composer's agent, provider, model and reasoning effort.
+An existing side chat keeps its own saved choices.
+A saved agent that is no longer selectable falls back to the source agent.
+A cold catalog does not replace the source agent with another agent.
+Read-only behavior comes from a trailing side-chat prompt, so the agent definition and tool schema stay unchanged.
+
+### Why BTW inherits the source agent
+
+The same agent preserves the source configuration used for the cached prompt prefix.
+An independent Plan default changes the selected agent even when the user only wants a side question.
 
